# Binary assets must never get EOL conversion — a PDF's byte offsets (its xref
# table) are corrupted the moment LF becomes CRLF, which silently breaks it on a
# fresh checkout. Test fixtures under tests/ live or die by this.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xlsx binary
*.parquet binary
